{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43320","headline":"龙池春草 · 万俟造","name":"龙池春草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖积龙池绿，晴连御苑春。\n迎风茎未偃，裛露色犹新。\n苒苒分阶砌，离离杂荇苹。\n细丛依远渚，疎影落轻沦。\n迟引萦花蝶，偏宜拾翠人。\n那怜献赋者，惆怅惜兹辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万俟造","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}